                                                "sense_id": "8fb71e58-6723-392e-89a8-d7cbccd7631b",
                                                "text": "Each vault has three segments: “preflight” (the movement from the springboard onto the table), “block” (the moment the hands touch and leave the table) and “postflight” (the flips and twists before landing). […] Handspring and Tsukahara vaults are less common than Yurchenko-style vaults, but some gymnasts specialize in them."
